WEBVTT

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:17.000
Tencent Video presents

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:29.920
Adapted from the bestseller The King's Avatar
by Butterfly Blue

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.270
Copyright Notice
All rights preserved by China Literature

00:00:56.220 --> 00:01:00.930
♪ The dawn piercing horn is being played by now ♪

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:04.060
♪ Is that a fantasy or just past memories? ♪

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.600
♪ Eyes wide open, but I can't tell ♪

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:12.560
♪ which side of the road am I running on ♪

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:19.930
♪ Would I know the memories and breaks mixed in morning light? ♪

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:23.310
♪ They said you shouldn't march on ♪

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.810
♪ They said you have to say goodbye ♪

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:30.310
♪ They say you can have no tomorrow but dark night ♪

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.930
♪ Over the finish line ♪

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:35.430
♪ I will restart my dream again ♪

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:37.220
♪ Even if it's dangerous ♪

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:42.430
♪ I will keep marching and get my crown back ♪

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.850
♪ Put on my armor and step to the unknown future ♪

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:51.020
♪ Hold on to my light on the road together with you ♪

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:52.100
♪ becomes the power that supports me ♪

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:55.680
♪ The morning light that burns in my heart ♪

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.060
♪ will blossom at dawn ♪

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.770
♪ Dawn of Glory on battlefield ♪

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:04.020
♪ I will show you my edge ♪

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:12.270
<b>Professional Scrap-Picker</b>

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.290
There's just so many possibilities for an Unspecialized.

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:21.120
What kind of sick combo is this?

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.500
Do you have to go that hard on me?

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:24.000
Captain Yu.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.950
It'd be a shame for him to go down like this.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:26.830
I say you should kick his ass.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:28.290
Captain Yu, What do you think?

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:30.450
Shaotian is about to lose.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:31.540
Why?

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:33.450
Unspecialized can be complicated.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:34.790
It takes experience to fight this class.

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:38.580
The combo used by Ye Qiu,
none of them are of the routine pack.

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:41.040
So Shaotian is having a little trouble keeping up.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:42.500
I'm impressed.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.450
What should I do?

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:44.580
I'm about to die!

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:45.120
Huang.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.370
Your captain's pointing you in the right direction.

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:47.160
Did you hear that?

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.200
Get lost.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:48.830
Captain Yu

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:49.790
He told you to get lost.

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:54.080
No response at all.

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:55.200
Is his headset really off?

00:02:59.160 --> 00:02:59.790
Collapsing Fist!

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:04.660
Next move, should be Shadow Cloak.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.700
Falling Phoenix Slash!

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:26.120
He managed to find the combo's pattern in such short notice.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.160
Even interrupted the combo.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.500
Huang Shaotian is a true opportunist.

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:32.040
Upward Slash.

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:34.160
Triple Slash.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:35.830
Lunge.

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:36.370
Moonlight Slash.

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:36.830
Upward Slash.

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:37.580
Formless Phantom Blade.

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:38.040
Headwind Strike.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.330
Busted, busted, busted!

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:41.700
Not again.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.250
The same moves won't work on me.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:48.580
Your vision is blocked by your umbrella.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:50.580
Without headsets, you can't tell the origin of the attack.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:51.370
Old Ye.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:52.870
You walked right into your own trap.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:56.500
What?

00:03:58.290 --> 00:03:59.200
Shadow Clone?

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:04.750
I thought you can't hear me!

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:06.540
Master Ye was not affected by the previous trash talk at all.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:07.500
How can he do that?

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.200
Is he immune to trash talk?

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.250
He is Invincible.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:10.790
What's going on?

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:12.500
I thought he's headset was off.

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:14.040
Well...

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:18.660
Before Master Ye entered, he told me to mute the voice.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:22.040
But as for skill sound effects, he can still hear them.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.580
He muted the voice only?

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:39.120
This is so very shameless of you.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:41.370
You have to inform your rivals before changing the rules!

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:49.870
Have you been talking all these time?

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:50.950
Go to hell!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:51.910
One more, one more round!

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:53.870
Not gonna happen.

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:54.870
Get in the line.

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:56.750
Yes.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:58.330
You should be at the end of the line.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:00.830
It's my turn.

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:02.330
Of what?

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:02.750
It's bedtime already.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:04.080
You all hanging around here.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.080
What, got no training tomorrow?

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.250
What the heck do you think you're doing?

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.200
You think he's not popular enough?

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.410
Try to add some to his name, huh?

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:17.830
(Pro-accounts besieged Lord Grim)

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:19.500
Manager Cui, take it easy.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:20.370
(Pro-accounts besieged Lord Grim)

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:22.200
We might have drawn some attentions with the entering.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:22.830
(Pro-accounts besieged Lord Grim)

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:24.870
But the arena room has a password to it.

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:26.040
Regular players can't get in there.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.410
This news is so detailed.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.250
I bet it's another stunt pulled by Heavenly Justice.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.070
We were used Enough.

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:35.080
Has Ye Qiu's identity been exposed?

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:38.830
Well, when Huang Shaotian called him out,

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.580
he did mention Ye Qiu's name.

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:43.620
Sir, we have reporters out there.

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:44.160
What should we do?

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:47.950
Tell them to give us a minute.

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:53.870
Well, if they really want to play the identity card,

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.790
then maybe we can start it first.

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:05.500
Ye Xiu.

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.950
Boss, what's with the remodeling?

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:12.080
I told you we are going to have a training room.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.290
The previous box was not big enough.

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:14.700
But that's not important right now.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:15.290
Come with me.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.040
You're on TV now.

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:20.750
(Arles News on Esports)

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:23.700
Besiege on Lord Grim has caused heated discussion.

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:26.000
It is said that this master player in 10th server

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.000
is Ye Qiu, the former captain of Excellent Era.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.000
So what is really going on?

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.330
Let's take a look at the responses from the major clubs.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:34.910
It should be.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.370
To be proficient in Unspecialized,

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.330
requires a great understanding of all the classes.

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:41.950
With the performances shown by Lord Grim,

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:44.410
Ye Qiu is no doubt the most likely.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:48.540
Unspecialized is not a class that
can be mastered by a newcomer.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:53.370
With this level of moves, is definitely Ye Qiu.

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:55.040
I believe it's him.

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:57.580
I think it's Ye Qiu.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:00.830
Because he was so good.

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:03.580
With all those pro-accounts at the scene,

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:05.080
and he managed to beat me like that?

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.160
I mean you can just tell, it has to be Ye Qiu.

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:09.500
What about Zhang Jiale, he's also former pro-player.

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:10.830
Zhang Jiale?

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.080
I called him.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:12.750
He said it wasn't him.

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.580
What do you think about this game?

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:16.660
Well I lost.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.200
But for pro-gamers, winning is just as common as losing.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:20.370
Besides, I was fighting with Ye Qiu.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:22.250
It's time to get out of the box.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.160
And see beyond the game itself.

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:27.290
For example, I've had a lot of things
in mind that I'd like to share with you today.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:28.120
Aren't you thrilled to hear them?

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:30.410
Well, thank you for your time!

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:31.540
Excuse me?

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:33.040
What do you think about this game, Captain Yu Wenzhou?

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.080
Do you have a copy of that game?

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.160
I have the HD version.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:37.540
I can send you a copy later.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.620
Lord Grim is Ye Qiu?

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.250
If Ye Qiu still wants to be involved in Glory,

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:45.950
then I don't understand

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:48.410
why did he choose to retire.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:54.370
Especially considering the fact that he
confronted Excellent Dynasty back in 10th Server.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:58.750
What's your opinion on Ye Qiu joining Heavenly Justice?

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.160
We respect the choices he made.

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:03.420
But Glory is a eSport game after all.

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:06.000
Excellent Era and Ye Qiu are in good relationship as always.

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:10.620
But in the arena, in the game I think we
should deal with it in a professional way.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:15.250
So I wish both Excellent Era
and Ye Qiu can do well in the game.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:16.500
What the heck?

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:18.040
Excellent Era is so shameless.

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:20.040
If you can't even stand this,

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:21.500
then you're gonna be in trouble.

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:23.330
I would never be like that.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:25.160
You won't.

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:26.200
But what about your opponents?

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.790
They'll come up with all kind s of rumors, all kinds of lies.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:30.660
When the reporter came to you,

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:32.870
you just gonna call them shameless?

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:36.790
Then what should I do?

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.290
Knock them down in the game.

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:42.850
Fight back with facts.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.200
Nothing can be more powerful than that.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:47.160
Well with this, how do you fight back with facts?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.790
Just enjoy my meal.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:50.040
Next news,

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:51.790
Application of Team Heavenly Sword

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.120
has been officially approved.

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:56.120
They will be joining Glory Pro-League in season 9.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.200
At the first press conference held by team Heavenly Sword,

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:01.290
Lou Guanning, their boss and team leader,

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:04.370
has responded to the question whether
Ye Qiu would join team Heavenly Sword.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:08.700
Ye Qiu the former captain of Excellent Era,
was not recruited by our team.

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:16.130
Can you tell us who is Lord Grim then?

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:18.870
He's our secret weapon.

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:19.950
So, no comment.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:22.410
See?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.000
That's the fact.

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.160
Not a bad counterattack, don't you think?

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:28.160
You...

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:30.080
You've had it all planned out?

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:31.500
More or less, yes.

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.160
It's mainly for Loulan Slash's publicity.

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:35.580
We're just a small, small part of this.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:37.330
And what about you?

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.000
What have you gained from all of these?

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:39.580
Me?

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:41.450
I told you.

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.540
More attention on Heavenly Sword and Lord Grim,

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:47.000
less likely we will be attacked by our rival clubs and guilds.

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:52.410
So you went through all of this
so that you can get your level up?

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:53.370
Yeah.

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:01.970
The King's Avatar 2

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:13.410
How do you think?

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:14.580
New training room.

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:15.410
Isn't it nice?

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.950
The sun is too bright.

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:19.200
Everything else is just fine.

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:20.620
Excuse me?

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:22.580
I ordered these French windows specifically, okay?

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:24.040
You ain't got no taste.

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:25.310
What's your problem?

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:28.450
Your identity went viral on the Internet.

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:29.910
After Heavily Sword's press conference,

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:31.790
they interviewed another round of the pro-gamers.

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:34.240
Han Wenqing debunked your wordplay.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:36.640
Did Heavenly Sword deny Lord Grim as Ye Qiu?

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:39.750
If Lord Grim is not Ye Qiu, then who is he?

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:42.870
It's all over the Internet, they say
you're with Heavenly Sword.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:44.540
They said you're not with them right now,

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.830
because retired players can only
come back a year after the retirement.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.410
But apparently you two already have an agreement.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:52.080
I think now everybody knows about your identity.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:52.950
It's just a matter of time anyway.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:55.980
Why don't they just use Ye Qiu's name for marketing?

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:58.910
They'll get more publicity that way.

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.370
Because they know I won't join them.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:03.200
So they better not talk big.

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:04.680
Think about it yourself.

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:06.250
Think about my ass.

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:07.000
Just say it.

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:09.250
Busy.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.120
BOSS.

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:18.650
(Level 55, Leveling Area - Chalk Town)

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:22.310
More damage, more!

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:23.790
(Blue Brook, Ice of Dawn)
More damage, more!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.870
The other guilds will be here any time.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:33.910
Isn't that one of the Five Great
Experts in Blue Brook, Ice of Dawn?

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:34.330
Wait.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.830
This boss is a level 65 Wilderness Escort, right?

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:38.910
How can it be in here, level 55 leveling area?

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:41.080
They probably summoned this boss with some other props.

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:42.830
So that they can kill it here secretly.

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:44.250
What are you up to?

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:45.080
You're going to steal it?

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.250
That would be despicable.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:48.870
I'm going to do scrap-picking.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:49.750
Scrap...

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:50.950
Scrap-picking?

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:55.330
Are you saying you gonna rush into the field in trash gear,

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.830
and try to steal the drop items when others got slayed?

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:59.830
That shabby scrap-picking?

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:01.950
Yeah, so?

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:02.830
You!

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.000
You are a professional master!

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:05.500
You!

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:06.700
How can you do that?

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.200
Be quiet. Don't get me exposed.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:10.410
Are you coming or what?

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:11.620
You...

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:15.580
Never mind.

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:18.000
Wow! You guys are busy.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:23.200
A level 65 wild escort is not worth
the trouble for Ice of Dawn to come here,

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:24.790
Mugwort?

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.470
(Herb Garden, Mugwort)

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:29.370
He's from the Herb Garden.

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:32.580
This place...

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:34.080
I see.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.310
Brother Dawn wants to trap the boss into
the dog hole in the house and kill it secretly.

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:38.770
(Excellent Dynasty, Tulip)

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:40.450
Princess golden.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.330
The Excellent Dynasty is also here.

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:43.540
You know her?

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:45.830
You two are a little slow on this.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.700
Falling Palm.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:05.000
What?

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:08.290
Someone's in there!

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:09.790
Don't panic.

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:12.120
It's me. It's me.

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:15.330
Lord Grim!

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.250
Ice of Dawn.

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:20.950
I am quite tight with Blue River in your guild.

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:21.830
You need help?

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:23.950
We can join hands with Excellent Dynasty.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:25.830
Get rid of the Herb Garden first.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.450
Who died and made you king?

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:31.000
Excellent Dynasty, you can all come here.

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.160
Didn't you see the news?

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.410
I'm Ye Qiu.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:36.290
Don't listen to him.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.250
The boss is fixed on Blue Brook now.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:39.910
We should kill Blue Brook first.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:43.160
I mean, you all just gonna stand here?

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:51.410
Shadow Clone!

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:57.120
Take him down!

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:58.330
Kill the leader first!

00:13:58.700 --> 00:13:59.500
Well said.

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:02.250
See you!

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:08.620
Brother dawn, sorry.

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.620
Focus damage.

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:13.700
He took off both Blue Brook and Herb Garden in a second.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.790
He's doing a favor for us Excellent Dynasty.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.250
Is he really Ye Qiu?

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:18.910
Now this is low!

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:22.450
Take down Blue Brook!

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:23.870
Vengeance for Mugwort!

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:24.620
Go!

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:27.040
Kill them all!

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:37.200
What should we do now?

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.000
Come help us!

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:40.810
Invite Lord Grim to your team?

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.060
He has a team already!

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:45.400
What do you want?

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:48.620
Scrap-picking.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:50.080
What?

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.620
Team leader, what should we do next?

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.250
Blue Brook is crazy!

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.500
Others are waiting scrap-pickers will
wait for someone to drop dead.

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:02.410
You choose to create death.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:04.080
I've never seen any scrap-picker like you.

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:05.120
You're good.

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:06.450
Of course.

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:07.910
Even as a scrap-picker, you still have to work hard.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:20.040
All right.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.200
Let's do the picking.

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:34.580
This is a nice one.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:40.620
It's Deception.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.120
He's doing scrap-picking again!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.870
Stop him!

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.290
Deception.

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:50.080
You were the one who attacked me last time.

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.450
Give me back my items.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.200
Worthless wretch.

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:10.120
Underground Tunneling.

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:11.040
Amazing.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:12.660
Deception.

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:14.450
A ruthless scrap-picker in Heavenly Domain.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:16.080
Where are you going?

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:17.620
Scrap-picking.

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.750
He's got all the good stuffs.

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:20.790
I have to get them back.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.120
This is not scrap-picking.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.000
You're killing people for their items.

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:24.080
Yeah.

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:25.290
I learned from the best.

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:29.660
Can you trace him?

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:30.790
Of course.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:32.200
Those extra weights will slow him down.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:33.830
He's got so many things in his bag.

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:34.700
He's not gonna be fast.

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.660
But we've lost the sign of him.

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:37.870
Do you know where he went?

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:38.790
It's just around the corner.

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:40.200
With his current speed.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:42.000
He can never escape my sight.

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:43.200
What do you mean?

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.450
That guy's hiding?

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:47.750
We need to find him before he's off the line.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.450
Go check the room at 257, 186.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.330
Only in that direction, has no sounds of triggered mobs.

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:02.120
OK.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:03.080
Be careful, though.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:04.260
This guy is a tough cookie.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.620
Neck Bind.

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:21.700
I'm going to kill him!

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:22.750
Don't worry.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:23.330
I got this.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:33.370
You anticipated my attack.

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:34.330
Impressive.

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:53.880
Flame Cut?

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:04.660
If I didn't have that many things
on me, you can never escape this.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:09.250
If I didn't know you had so many on you,
I wouldn't have made that move either.

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:10.160
Cut the crap.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:17.540
Seriously?

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.580
He's running head to head with Ye Xiu's APM?

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:21.620
He is fast.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.660
Hello, need help?

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:31.250
Watch out!

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:32.870
It's the water dungeon.

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:39.790
Don't run if you got the balls!

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:40.750
It's okay.

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:42.790
He's not getting anywhere.

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:44.660
How could this be?

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:45.700
I got him...

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:47.500
It's the Shadow Clone.

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:48.370
But when?

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:54.950
No.

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:56.330
It's impossible.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:58.620
What's so impossible about this?

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:00.370
You're not the only one who can anticipate moves.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:03.660
How did you know I used Hundred Streams?

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:08.830
Right, when Deception did the move, he was back to Lord Grim.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.910
No way Ye Xiu could have seen his moves.

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:14.370
You're not bad.

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:16.910
I have to come up with some unconventional means.

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:19.910
Unconventional means?

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:21.330
What?

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.160
This is too low!

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:25.330
You peeked through my screen?

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:25.950
Don't move.

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:26.660
You're blocking the screen.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.660
I advise you to give up.

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:31.700
With my unconventional means,
your little tricks are not going to work.

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:33.000
Damn it.

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:34.910
The evacuation routes were all blocked.

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:36.950
Who are these two?

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:38.950
Especially that Tactician.

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.370
Wait, he's not a Tactician.

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:43.580
He used a blade.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.100
And a spear.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.140
Or a shield?

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:50.330
What is your class?

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.080
I mean.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:54.080
Don't tell me you didn't realize till now.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:54.950
level 52.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:56.080
No class.

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:58.830
No information on the weapon.
(Thousand Chance Umbrella, Silver Weapon)

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:00.700
Is this a silver weapon?

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:02.040
Man.

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:03.290
Don't you watch the news?

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:03.950
What news?

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.830
I went viral these days.

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:07.660
You play Glory and you don't know about me?

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:08.500
I'm surprised.

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:11.040
Alright!

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.290
I knew it was a trap!

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:14.200
Lord Grim stirred things up.

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:15.950
Deception did the scrap-picking.

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:17.450
You two are a team.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.410
What are you talking about?

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:21.200
Tape them.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:22.290
Put both of them on tape.

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:23.120
And then kill them.

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.000
OK.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:24.980
Run!

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.500
That's so ungrateful.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:30.910
He bailed without saying hello.

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:34.660
Catch them!

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:35.540
Don't let them get out of the field.

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:43.870
You did a great job as newcomers.

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.700
This drop item is more suitable for swordsmen.

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:46.540
You can have it.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:47.700
Keep on the good work.

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:49.580
Thank you, sister.

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:53.950
Sister Chasing Haze is such a bully.

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:57.620
She leaves the fine items only to her own people.

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:01.200
Teamed up with all the newcomers and bully the rest.

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:02.370
How could she do that?

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:03.160
She went too far.

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:04.830
Don't worry.

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:06.000
We'll teach her a lesson.

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:12.580
Don't feel bad.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.790
She got help from the experts in the guild.

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:17.370
You are just so good!

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:18.790
It is OK.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:20.330
If that ever happens again, just let me know.

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:23.160
Always been the gossip girl.

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:25.370
Princess Golden.

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:38.040
It's you!

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:42.620
This woman bullied me again!

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:44.580
Hurry up and attack her!

00:21:58.040 --> 00:21:58.830
You're still there?

00:21:58.830 --> 00:21:59.750
You should run.

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:01.450
I'm already dead.

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.040
You...

00:22:03.370 --> 00:22:04.620
you only live a day, huh?

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:05.790
That's my business.

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:07.410
Check your inventory.

00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:09.750
The drop rate is very high in Heavenly Domain.

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:14.720
You lose Afterglow Hairband and Rosie Cannon

00:22:18.450 --> 00:22:20.000
Two at a time.

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:20.620
You're in a row, man.

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:22.000
My hair band!

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:23.290
My rose cannon!

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:24.000
Don't cry.

00:22:24.350 --> 00:22:25.580
Out with the old, in with the new.

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:27.000
I'm not crying.

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:30.200
Level 70 purple weapon.

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:31.830
Took me a long time to get them.

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:33.620
Who's gonna get them now?

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:34.750
Don't worry.

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:36.450
There will be cannons.

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:38.040
There will be hair band, too.

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:39.750
What are you going to do?

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:40.830
You go to the bind first.

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:42.410
I'm going to have fun here.

00:22:43.700 --> 00:22:44.370
Don't.

00:22:44.370 --> 00:22:45.540
It's important that you get out of here.

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:46.830
What should you do if you lose your silver weapon?

00:22:46.830 --> 00:22:47.910
You're wrong.

00:22:48.500 --> 00:22:50.000
The silver weapon is no big deal.

00:22:50.450 --> 00:22:51.540
I can make hundreds of it as long as I have the materials.

00:22:52.750 --> 00:22:55.370
Besides, they have to kill me to get my item.

00:22:55.870 --> 00:22:57.620
I would love to see who can really kill me.

00:23:19.430 --> 00:23:22.220
♪ If you can't see the sky with your head up ♪

00:23:23.640 --> 00:23:27.350
♪ Then look down and focus on where you're heading ♪

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:32.180
♪ We all know that we don't want to bury our dreams ♪

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:34.350
♪ Step back for the next take-off ♪

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:38.970
♪ All channels are reconnected ♪

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:40.930
♪ I remember you said you would wait ♪

00:23:41.180 --> 00:23:43.060
♪ Fine melody under my fingertips ♪

00:23:43.060 --> 00:23:45.220
♪ Perfect performance in digital world ♪

00:23:47.930 --> 00:23:49.930
♪ Brand-new melody, brand-new you and me ♪

00:23:49.970 --> 00:23:53.220
♪ Our passion will support us to the end ♪

00:23:53.220 --> 00:23:56.470
♪ Light the fire in you ♪

00:23:56.470 --> 00:23:58.600
♪ Shine away the weakness in dark ♪

00:23:58.600 --> 00:24:00.310
♪ You can laugh at me, you can look down on me ♪

00:24:00.310 --> 00:24:02.100
♪ They would only drive me further ♪

00:24:02.220 --> 00:24:05.350
♪ Take record of our pulses ♪

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:09.350
♪ All those provocations ♪

00:24:09.350 --> 00:24:11.520
♪ They will only firm my steps ♪
